spice
   * Transistor M1 (NMOS)
M1 4 1 5 N-type

   * Transistor M2 (NMOS)
M2 2 1 5 N-type

   * Transistor M3 (PMOS)
M3 6 2 7 P-type

   * Current Source ISS
ISS 5 0 DC <value>

   * Voltage Supply VDD
VDD 7 0 DC <value>

   * Nodes:
   * 1 - Vin
   * 2 - Connection between M2 and M3 gates
   * 4 - Drain of M1
   * 5 - Ground (Common for ISS current source)
   * 6 - Vout
   * 7 - VDD